codex
The deeper residual showed the backend was not eliminating the impossible `"$cells"` branch from an abstract remainder map, even with a negative key constraint. I’m making the loop frames exact instead: these are the actual local bindings present at each loop head, with parent `0`. This both preserves the whole footprint and gives the circularities a decidable binding shape.
apply patch
