The nested scan is now fully proved. For the remaining construction loop, I’m removing modulo from the program and tracking the alternating position with a Boolean `take_one`. That permits two mutually coinductive loop claims (`true`/`false`) and two mutually recursive data summaries whose symbolic equations fold across one exact back-edge without unbounded case splitting.
