The bounded state is correct immediately before the back-edge. The remaining explosion comes from AC-map matching: an arbitrary `RESTHEAP` lets the circularity consider every framed heap entry as the result list. In the actual target execution the input is unboxed and the result list is the only heap object, so I’m pinning the claim to that exact heap footprint. This is a domain narrowing to the exact reachable state, not loss of state.
